      "message": "Adding to GENERATED_AND_SYSTEM_PATTERNS would be equivalent to adding LCOV_EXCL_START around the whole files, in the Zephyr tests only. But since you excluded the stub functions you wanted to exclude, you probably don\u0027t need to change GENERATED_AND_SYSTEM_PATTERNS.\n\nThe patterns here are for the legacy tests only, which I don\u0027t believe affects the CQ low coverage.",
