      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, the goal of this CL is to exclude the entire files instead of individual functions, so maybe I do want it in `GENERATED_AND_SYSTEM_PATTERNS`. Any concern about doing that and making the name not make sense anymore?\n\nI thought that the basic operation of `lcov` was to include in the denominator only files that were included in the build of the coverage executables. I believe the mocks were only included in the legacy build, and I wouldn\u0027t have expected them to be in the denominator of a Zephyr coverage run anyway. Is that right?",
